From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: allwinner: a733: Add the crypto engine

Add the non-secure interface of the A733 crypto engine (A733 manual,
chapter 2 and section 19.1.6) with its interrupt CE_NS (12.2.3.1), the
CE and CE_SYS bus gates and resets, the module clock and the MBUS gate
of the clock controller (4.1.6.84, 4.1.6.117, 4.1.6.118), and the RC
oscillator of the RTC, from which the TRNG clock is divided (4.1.6.117,
9.1.4.1). The engine sits behind the MSI_LITE0 bridge, whose gates the
clock driver keeps running.

Not covered: the secure interface at 0x04603800.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: the engine probes at this address with its
interrupt, clocks and resets, and its gates close in runtime suspend.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
index 39ebca8687b9..fab122ae626c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun60i-a733.dtsi
@@ -1034,6 +1034,17 @@ dma: dma-controller@4601000 {
 			#dma-cells = <1>;
 		};
 
+		crypto: crypto@4603000 {
+			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-crypto";
+			reg = <0x04603000 0x800>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 168 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH 0>;
+			clocks = <&ccu CLK_BUS_CE>, <&ccu CLK_CE>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_MBUS_CE>, <&rtc CLK_IOSC>,
+				 <&ccu CLK_BUS_CE_SYS>;
+			clock-names = "bus", "mod", "ram", "trng", "sys";
+			resets = <&ccu RST_BUS_CE>, <&ccu RST_BUS_CE_SYS>;
+		};
+
 		de_top: clock-controller@5008000 {
 			compatible = "allwinner,sun60i-a733-de-top";
 			reg = <0x05008000 0x100>;
